+ * LSX optimized hash slide, based on Intel SSE implementation
+ *
+ * Copyright (C) 2017 Intel Corporation
+ * Copyright (C) 2025 Vladislav Shchapov <vladislav@shchapov.ru>
+ * Authors:
+ *   Arjan van de Ven   <arjan@linux.intel.com>
